<title>USA: Berkeley, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>Berkeley, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Sec. said it won $10.500 million of Berkeley, Calif., 1997 general obligation bonds, Election of 1992, Series C, with a true interest cost of 5.39 percent.</p>
</text>
